{%- comment -%}
  AJ Shop by Price — the browsing entry point.

  Price is the one axis this catalogue can actually be navigated by. Supplier
  categories arrive from Collective as whatever each supplier called them
  ("Ceramic" for 43 of 54 products, blank for five more), so a category nav
  built on them would be incoherent. Price is uniform, meaningful to a bargain
  shopper, and survives any mix of vendors.

  Tiles are typographic rather than image-led on purpose: a price band has no
  representative image, and picking one product's photo to stand for "$20 to
  $30" would misrepresent the other eighteen.

  Counts come from `collection.all_products_count`, so a band that empties out
  says so rather than leading to a dead page. Empty bands are skipped entirely.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign chosen = section.settings.collections
  assign renderable = 0
  for collection in chosen
    if collection.all_products_count > 0
      assign renderable = renderable | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- if renderable > 0 -%}
  <div
    id="shop-by-price"
    class="aj-price-nav color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} section spacing-style"
    style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}"
  >
    <div class="page-width">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="aj-price-nav__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
        <p class="aj-price-nav__subheading">{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      <ul class="aj-price-nav__grid" role="list">
        {%- for collection in chosen -%}
          {%- if collection.all_products_count == 0 -%}
            {%- continue -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Ships Free is not a price band, so it does not get the band color.
            It is the same distinction the cart and the product cards already
            make in cyan, and keeping it here means one idea has one color
            across the whole site rather than three.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <li class="aj-price-nav__item">
            <a
              class="aj-price-nav__tile{% if collection.handle == 'ships-free' %} aj-price-nav__tile--free{% endif %}"
              href="{{ collection.url }}"
            >
              <span class="aj-price-nav__label">{{ collection.title | escape }}</span>
              <span class="aj-price-nav__count">
                {{ collection.all_products_count }}
                {%- if collection.all_products_count == 1 %} item{% else %} items{% endif -%}
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="aj-price-nav aj-price-nav--empty page-width">
    <p>
      <strong>No collections selected.</strong>
      Pick your price band collections in this section's settings. Bands with no
      products in them are skipped automatically.
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-price-nav__heading {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .aj-price-nav__subheading {
    margin: 0 0 var(--padding-md, 1.5rem);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .aj-price-nav__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--padding-sm, 1rem);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .aj-price-nav__grid {
      /* auto-fit rather than a fixed count so adding or removing a band does
         not leave a ragged final row */
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(11rem, 1fr));
    }
  }

  /*
    THE SAME TILES THE NAV DROPDOWN USES.

    This was five hairline-bordered white rectangles with grey counts — a
    default component on a store whose whole personality is loud, sitting
    directly under a deal card in ink, yellow and purple. It read as something
    nobody had got to yet.

    Ink on yellow is 11.17:1, and it matches the Shop by price dropdown exactly,
    so the same idea looks the same whether it is reached from the header or
    from the page. Yellow is legitimate here rather than a borrowed saving
    color: this section IS the bargain hunt, which is what yellow means on this
    store.

    Ships Free is cyan carrying ink at 8.87:1 — the color that already means
    "shipping is free" on product cards, in the cart and on the PDP.
  */
  .aj-price-nav__tile {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.2rem;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000);
    color: var(--aj-brand-ink, #282828);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.12s ease;
  }

  .aj-price-nav__tile--free {
    background: var(--aj-ships-free-bg, #5cd8f8);
    color: var(--aj-ships-free-ink, #282828);
  }

  .aj-price-nav__tile:hover,
  .aj-price-nav__tile:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  /* The number is the whole choice, so it is the size of one. */
  .aj-price-nav__label {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    /* Bands read as "$10 to $20" — tabular figures keep the tiles aligned. */
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* Ink at 0.65 rather than a grey: on a saturated ground a grey goes muddy,
     whereas the same ink faded keeps the tile looking like one color. */
  .aj-price-nav__count {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.65;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aj-price-nav__tile { transition: none; }
    .aj-price-nav__tile:hover { transform: none; }
  }

  .aj-price-nav--empty {
    padding-block: var(--padding-xl, 3rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aj-price-nav__tile { transition: none; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Shop by Price",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Links to your price band collections. Bands with no products are hidden automatically."
    },
    {
      "type": "collection_list",
      "id": "collections",
      "label": "Price bands",
      "limit": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Shop by price"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "New finds added all the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "AJ Shop by Price"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
